WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.330
Record what happened, where and how serious it is, give it to someone, and follow it to the end.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:15.420
Something happened in the mall? Report it straight away from Security & cleaning.

3
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.340
Choose Report an incident.

4
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:25.330
Pick the kind of incident and how serious it is.

5
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:34.680
Say in a few words what happened.

6
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:40.840
Where it happened, and the cameras that saw it.

7
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:49.560
Choose who follows it up.

8
00:00:49.560 --> 00:01:00.540
Describe it as you would to the police.

9
00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:05.780
Save the report. It gets its own number.

10
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:15.380
Follow it up here: the status, a police report number, the outcome. Every change goes on the timeline, and photos go above.

11
00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:22.840
At the end of the shift, write the handover so the next team knows what is still open.
